WEBVTT

01:51.200 --> 01:52.000
Sister Pei.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.070
Sister Pei!

01:56.430 --> 01:57.229
Sister Pei!

01:58.229 --> 01:59.039
Sister Pei?

02:02.710 --> 02:03.510
Sister Pei?

02:04.350 --> 02:05.150
Sister Pei?

02:16.030 --> 02:16.800
Jiu.

02:29.240 --> 02:30.040
Where's Heng?

04:26.360 --> 04:27.270
Sister.

04:30.120 --> 04:31.560
You finally succeeded.

04:39.240 --> 04:40.170
Unfortunately,

04:42.270 --> 04:44.680
I can't be with you anymore.

04:48.960 --> 04:49.870
This time,

04:51.750 --> 04:53.920
I'm really leaving.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.750
I'm happy

05:01.120 --> 05:02.920
that I'm no longer your burden.

05:05.070 --> 05:07.000
I've become your armor.

05:10.950 --> 05:11.560
But...

05:13.430 --> 05:14.360
But what?

05:17.070 --> 05:17.870
Nothing.

05:22.720 --> 05:24.190
But the fate of the armor

05:24.920 --> 05:26.160
is destined to break.

05:27.310 --> 05:28.750
Just like the fate of snow

05:29.950 --> 05:31.160
is destined to melt.

05:40.720 --> 05:41.510
This is

05:44.680 --> 05:46.040
my last time

05:47.560 --> 05:49.240
protecting you.

05:56.920 --> 05:57.510
You

05:58.720 --> 05:59.870
must...

06:04.240 --> 06:07.560
Live on well.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.870
Don't leave me.

06:13.310 --> 06:15.800
Don't leave me alone.

06:19.480 --> 06:20.270
Heng.

06:46.510 --> 06:47.510
Heng!

06:48.190 --> 06:49.560
Pei Siheng!

06:52.240 --> 06:53.240
Heng.

08:56.750 --> 08:58.280
I have a way to deal with him.

08:58.870 --> 08:59.720
What is it?

09:01.030 --> 09:02.760
My true form is the pagoda tree.

09:04.550 --> 09:06.880
I'm restricted by the Ever-Burning Wood,

09:08.150 --> 09:09.550
but at the same time,

09:10.320 --> 09:11.750
I can attract the fire.

09:17.270 --> 09:19.120
I'll attract the fire of Wen Zongyu's

09:19.120 --> 09:20.270
Ever-Burning Wood

09:21.030 --> 09:22.630
to weaken his demonic power.

09:22.910 --> 09:25.440
You take the chance to destroy his inner core.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.200
He will definitely die.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.120
But...

09:31.080 --> 09:32.740
But this way, you will die too.

09:38.870 --> 09:39.670
Li Lun.

09:40.030 --> 09:41.080
What are you doing?

09:41.080 --> 09:43.210
I'll give you half of my demonic power.

09:48.440 --> 09:52.040
With the demonic powers of the pagoda ghost and Bingyi together,

09:53.840 --> 09:55.910
Wen Zongyu won't put up a fight.

10:01.150 --> 10:02.080
Zhuo Yichen.

10:05.440 --> 10:06.600
I'll leave it to you.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.390
Don't let me down.

10:12.150 --> 10:13.600
Since we were born,

10:15.750 --> 10:16.960
he and I

10:18.350 --> 10:19.870
were equal

10:21.360 --> 10:22.820
and always tied in a fight.

10:28.840 --> 10:31.000
I can't stand seeing him so useless.

10:51.550 --> 10:52.360
Zhu Yan.

10:54.390 --> 10:55.670
I'll give you

10:59.240 --> 11:00.370
the remaining half.

12:28.480 --> 12:29.080
This is...

12:31.790 --> 12:32.910
The Truth Eye.

12:48.150 --> 12:49.270
These eyes

12:51.120 --> 12:52.580
were not mine originally.

13:10.720 --> 13:12.050
I'm giving it to you now.

13:15.200 --> 13:18.030
I hope you can see the world clearly.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.270
Don't be like me.

13:38.030 --> 13:38.960
Li Lun!

13:40.240 --> 13:41.510
I once vowed...

13:41.510 --> 13:41.910
Li Lun!

13:42.720 --> 13:44.320
To protect the Wilderness

13:44.840 --> 13:46.360
until my death.

13:48.200 --> 13:49.320
I, Li Lun,

13:50.080 --> 13:51.360
live up to my vow

13:51.960 --> 13:53.480
and keep my promise.

13:56.480 --> 13:57.600
Zhuo Yichen!

14:00.750 --> 14:02.200
Look carefully.

14:02.910 --> 14:04.480
Don't miss!

15:24.870 --> 15:26.030
Wen Zongyu,

15:26.440 --> 15:28.300
we've done too many wrong things.

15:29.080 --> 15:30.320
So...

15:31.510 --> 15:33.000
let's die together!

15:42.790 --> 15:43.600
Zhuo!

16:13.550 --> 16:14.200
Wing.

18:46.830 --> 18:47.960
Dharma.

18:48.510 --> 18:49.440
Return!

19:08.640 --> 19:10.240
See through

19:10.520 --> 19:12.400
all illusions!

22:01.880 --> 22:02.680
Jiu.

22:03.510 --> 22:04.790
You can't go there

22:05.270 --> 22:06.400
when Sir isn't here.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.690
There's a strong barrier here.

22:08.960 --> 22:09.890
You'll get hurt.

22:10.880 --> 22:12.640
Why is a barrier set here?

22:13.110 --> 22:14.370
To protect something?

22:15.110 --> 22:16.040
He didn't say it.

22:17.400 --> 22:19.160
But it must be very important.

22:32.270 --> 22:33.200
Zhao Yuanzhou.

22:33.880 --> 22:36.110
Do you really think you defeated me?

22:42.110 --> 22:43.920
Like a phoenix rising from the ashes,

22:43.920 --> 22:46.240
I can be reborn countless times

22:46.240 --> 22:48.300
from the Ever-Burning Wood's ashes.

23:09.590 --> 23:11.000
I was right.

23:12.000 --> 23:15.240
The phoenix will be reborn

23:16.000 --> 23:18.060
from the Ever-Burning Wood's ashes.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.030
Jiu,

23:21.310 --> 23:22.110
go!

23:23.270 --> 23:24.400
Sir

23:24.720 --> 23:25.750
is now

23:25.880 --> 23:27.000
immortal.

23:30.240 --> 23:30.960
He can

23:31.160 --> 23:33.480
eternally be reborn

23:33.720 --> 23:35.960
from the Ever-Burning Wood's ashes.

23:36.510 --> 23:38.480
You can't defeat him.

23:38.480 --> 23:40.200
Go.

23:40.960 --> 23:42.240
Zhao Yuanzhou.

23:43.200 --> 23:44.000
Zhuo!

23:48.110 --> 23:48.920
Zhuo!

23:53.070 --> 23:54.510
Such a powerful barrier.

23:55.880 --> 23:58.540
It must be used to protect the ashes for rebirth.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.120
Jiu,

24:10.400 --> 24:11.240
go!

24:12.000 --> 24:12.830
This time...

24:17.310 --> 24:18.590
I must accomplish it.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.110
Zhao Yuanzhou.

26:18.030 --> 26:21.110
This barrier can block my body,

26:22.510 --> 26:24.370
but it can't block demonic power.

26:24.750 --> 26:26.880
I'll give you all my and Li Lun's power.

26:27.510 --> 26:29.770
Before he regains his power completely,

26:30.880 --> 26:32.110
destroy

26:33.400 --> 26:34.200
this barrier!

27:34.070 --> 27:34.930
Zhao Yuanzhou,

27:35.750 --> 27:37.350
if you destroy this barrier,

27:37.590 --> 27:38.960
he and I will both die.

27:54.070 --> 27:54.930
Zhao Yuanzhou,

27:56.400 --> 27:57.920
do it!

28:00.200 --> 28:01.600
But you're still inside.

28:03.640 --> 28:04.830
Ignore me.

28:06.310 --> 28:07.960
Your One-Word Spell

28:08.310 --> 28:09.400
has no effect on me.

28:14.590 --> 28:15.550
Hurry.

28:23.510 --> 28:24.240
Wing.

28:32.200 --> 28:33.110
No.

28:34.400 --> 28:35.310
No.

28:37.310 --> 28:38.440
Why is it like this?

28:42.480 --> 28:43.880
Zhao Yuanzhou!

28:45.510 --> 28:46.440
Hurry.

28:46.830 --> 28:49.030
The One-Word Spell is effective on you.

28:50.270 --> 28:51.440
You will die too.

29:56.550 --> 29:57.510
If I can't

30:00.110 --> 30:02.200
protect you anymore,

30:04.680 --> 30:06.810
you have to learn to protect yourself.

30:08.590 --> 30:09.400
Understand?

30:12.030 --> 30:12.830
I know.

30:25.880 --> 30:26.960
Brother Zhuo,

30:27.720 --> 30:28.750
this time,

30:29.640 --> 30:31.030
let me protect you!

31:07.030 --> 31:08.200
Brother Zhuo!

31:12.680 --> 31:13.920
Brother Zhuo!

31:22.400 --> 31:23.720
Brother Zhuo!

32:06.480 --> 32:08.720
Brother Zhuo!

32:57.350 --> 32:58.720
Do it!

33:02.240 --> 33:03.640
Zhao Yuanzhou!

33:17.200 --> 33:18.790
Brother Zhuo!

33:41.720 --> 33:43.440
Brother Zhuo!

33:55.440 --> 33:56.270
Break!

36:07.480 --> 36:08.360
Zhuo.

36:30.480 --> 36:31.280
Why?

36:33.110 --> 36:34.570
Why does my One-Word Spell

36:35.360 --> 36:36.840
not work on you again?

36:45.110 --> 36:46.240
I don't understand.

36:49.710 --> 36:50.880
Maybe God thinks

36:51.840 --> 36:53.280
I didn't do

36:56.230 --> 36:57.360
what I promised you.

37:24.360 --> 37:25.230
If

37:27.070 --> 37:29.530
the phoenix rebirth Wen Zongyu said is true,

37:32.430 --> 37:34.110
will he be reborn again?

37:36.400 --> 37:37.590
Someone must have

37:39.510 --> 37:41.280
destroyed the Ever-Burning Wood ashes

37:41.280 --> 37:42.880
that he needs

37:43.710 --> 37:44.840
to be reborn.

37:49.590 --> 37:50.450
Who could it be?

37:57.550 --> 37:59.750
Maybe someone who knows him well enough

38:01.960 --> 38:03.070
to think of this.

38:03.670 --> 38:04.320
It's Jiu.

38:36.480 --> 38:37.590
Mr. Zhuo,

38:39.480 --> 38:40.480
goodbye.

38:49.110 --> 38:49.960
This feather

38:51.070 --> 38:52.630
can bring you to Jiu's side.

38:53.880 --> 38:54.590
Go!

38:55.550 --> 38:56.760
I'll wait for you at the Demon Hunting Bureau.
